{'symbol': 'RHI', 'date': '2023-02-09 16:45:00', 'title': 'ROBERT HALF ANNOUNCES COMMON STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION AND QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "MENLO PARK, CALIF. , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROBERT HALF INTERNATIONAL INC. (NYSE: RHI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED THE REPURCHASE, FROM TIME TO TIME, OF UP TO AN ADDITIONAL 10 MILLION SHARES OF THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK ON THE OPEN MARKET OR IN PRIVATELY NEGOTIATED TRANSACTIONS, DEPENDING ON MARKET CONDITIONS."}